---
import Atmosphere from "../components/Atmosphere.astro";
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Vision from '../components/Vision.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Profile" description="Meet Lefaucheux Esports, founded in Singapore in 2024. Discover our identity, values, playing style and competitive ambitions."><PageHero title="OUR STORY." accent="OUR IDENTITY." breadcrumb="Profile" description="Built from passion. Driven by ambition. This is Lefaucheux Esports." />
<section class="section"><Atmosphere variant="signal" /><div class="container split"><h2>SINGAPORE ROOTS.<br /><span class="crimson">A FEARLESS FUTURE.</span></h2><div class="stack"><p>Founded in 2024 in Singapore, Lefaucheux Esports is a Mobile Legends: Bang Bang organization built around passion for the game and the ambition to compete.</p><p>LFX was formed to give talented Singapore players a chance to show what they can do. Opportunity can be hard to find; our ambition is to help players take that next step in competitive MLBB.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section identity"><Atmosphere variant="weave" /><div class="container"><div class="section-top"><h2>OUR <span class="crimson">IDENTITY.</span></h2></div><div class="editorial-list"><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Philosophy</h3><p>A team does not need to start big to achieve something big. Commitment, discipline, consistency and the courage to compete against the best matter. Every tournament, victory and defeat is part of becoming stronger.</p></article><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Team values</h3><p>Discipline. Loyalty. Growth. Resilience. Ambition.<br />The values that guide our team, on and beyond the battlefield.</p></article><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Playing style</h3><p>Aggressive. Strategic. Fearless.<br />Calculated aggression, strong teamwork and adaptability. We encourage decisive plays while maintaining discipline and communication as a team.</p></article><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Brand character</h3><p>Fearless, ambitious and hungry to prove ourselves. We want the LFX name to signal a competitive challenge. We don’t just want to participate; we want to be remembered.</p></article></div></div></section>
<Vision full /><section class="section identity"><Atmosphere variant="weave" /><div class="container"><div class="section-top"><h2>COMPETITIVE <span class="crimson">GOALS.</span></h2><p>Our ambitions guide the work ahead. They are goals, with no announced qualification or completion dates.</p></div><div class="editorial-list"><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Short term</h3><p>Establish a consistent competitive presence in Singapore’s Mobile Legends scene, strengthen our roster and challenge ourselves through major tournaments and qualifiers.</p></article><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Mid term</h3><p>Compete at a higher level in Singapore, develop stronger players and team infrastructure, and grow both our Singapore roster and Indonesian Ladies division.</p></article><article class="editorial-row"><h3>Long term</h3><p>Build LFX into one of Singapore’s recognized competitive MLBB organizations and earn opportunities to represent our name on the international stage.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section profile-contact"><Atmosphere variant="arena" /><div class="container split"><h2>LET’S BUILD<br /><span class="crimson">WHAT’S NEXT.</span></h2><div class="stack"><p>Share our ambition? Start a conversation about sponsorship, collaboration or partnership with LFX.</p><Button href="/join-us/">Work with LFX</Button></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.identity{background:var(--color-ink)}.profile-contact{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border-dark)}</style>
